{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085510/extras/f23e113e500a79602bb765ae31313b01.webp?t=1762243251\" width=617 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Ahoy, matey!</strong><br>Join the famously unlucky <strong>Captain Sharkbait</strong>\u00a0known far and wide for his name... and his <strong>two peg legs!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">One lazy afternoon, while snoozing aboard his &quot;ship&quot; &amp; dreaming of gold and treasure. He\u2019s startled awake by a gentle\u00a0knocking against the hull. Peering over the side, he spots a message in a bottle bobbing in the waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Could it be...? <strong>Treasure!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Come along with <strong>Captain Sharkbait</strong> for\u00a0<strong>15 unique levels</strong>.<br>Will <strong>Captain Sharkbait\u2019s</strong> luck finally turn around or sink to the depths once more?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085510/extras/beb980e08d8a114968dc60cc53ece0d2.webp?t=1762243251\" width=617 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- Smash Every Barrel / Collect every coin.</strong><br> ( Each level will have a certain amount of barrels or coins to collect )<br><br><strong>- Time Trail</strong><br> ( Race against the clock to complete the time trials, you\u2019ll have to be quick!)<br><br><strong>- Complete every level</strong><br>( Each level completed unlocks a challenge medal )<br>( Activating unlock all levels cheat will not activate the medal until level is complete )</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085510/extras/2d430e65a19acc83548062c772130360.webp?t=1762243251\" width=617 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- Big Head Mode</strong><br><br><br><strong>- Plunger Sword</strong><br><strong>- Jump Farts</strong><br><strong>- +5 Lives</strong><br><strong>- Unlock All levels</strong>  <br>  <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085510/extras/9cc0b64ea4b3ce92a73c42f4e79d442e.webp?t=1762243251\" width=617 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>This game is playable with:</strong><br><strong>Keyboard and Mouse -</strong> (\u00a0Remappable keys ) <br><strong>Xbox style Gamepad -</strong> ( Non Remappable )</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085510/extras/6cbc15d8e93157e9bc1d00b7af6d17a0.avif?t=1762243251\" width=322 height=276 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Support","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4085510/891b1111b9e5b59b81972e7bdaa762303bdd1e9c.jpg"},{"name":"Not Even a Scratch #1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4085